  "releaseNotes": "0.7.0: Added automatic proxy-aware type-map resolution fallback for runtime mapping (exact source type first, then base types/interfaces), with Castle DynamicProxy coverage tests. This release keeps target frameworks unchanged and updates package metadata/documentation.",
